-names></name><name><surname>Bray</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name><name><surname>Beckerle</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Talin distribution and phosphorylation in thrombin-activated platelets</article-title><source>J Cell Sci</source><year>1993</year><volume>106</volume><fpage>1189</fpage><lpage>1199</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8126100</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bolton</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Barry</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name><name><surname>Mosley</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Patel</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Jockusch</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilkinson</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Critchley</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Monoclonal antibodies recognizing the N- and C-terminal regions of talin disrupt actin stress fibers when microinjected into human fibroblasts</article-title><source>Cell Motil Cytoskelet</source><year>1997</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>363</fpage><lpage>376</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9096958</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bradley</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bishop</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>St. John</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Frelinger</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A simple, rapid method for the purification of Poly A&#x0002b; RNA</article-title><source>Biotechniques</source><year>1988</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>114</fpage><lpage>116</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2908499</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citati